window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When training ends, real life begins.</b></p> <p>A stadium built to hold insane numbers of spectators.</p> <p>Thousands of competitors.</p> <p>Multiple matches every single day.</p> <p>The qualifying tournament has begun.</p> <p>I have to fight, day in, day out, all the way to the end, with only my natural talents and the women I love to help me.</p> <p>And some of those I’m competing against will stop at NOTHING to see me fail.</p>"; 
